{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute. [[cite:obs-3bedb0e4eef65edb3afe24aa7705aec0bb68641c \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]\n\nThe retention rule is that records must be kept according to the schedule defined within the statute itself. [[cite:obs-3bedb0e4eef65edb3afe24aa7705aec0bb68641c \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]\n\nThe exact duration for which the records are kept is specified in the schedule of the statute, but the statute text does not provide a specific number of years. [[cite:obs-3bedb0e4eef65edb3afe24aa7705aec0bb68641c \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"0015c7efef7d4750fabec588300174ecf4832eef5bc63370d8afe1afcc8122a3","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added explicit statements about the statute's retention rule and the duration of record retention, each supported by the exact source quote from the statute observation obs-3bedb0e4eef65edb3afe24aa7705aec0bb68641c, as required by the user request."}